{
  "id": {
    "address": "messaging",
    "name": "encryption_history"
  },
  "doc": " Module: encryption_history\n\n Internal module for envelope encryption key management.\n Stores encrypted DEKs (Data Encryption Keys) with version tracking for key rotation.\n\n `EncryptionHistory` is a derived object from `MessagingNamespace`, enabling\n deterministic address derivation for MyData encryption namespacing.\n\n Uses client-provided UUIDs for derivation, enabling predictable group IDs\n for single-transaction encryption with MyData.\n\n All public entry points are in the `messaging` module:\n - `messaging::create_group` - creates group with encryption\n - `messaging::rotate_encryption_key` - rotates keys\n",
  "immediate_dependencies": [
    {
      "address": "myso",
      "name": "derived_object"
    },
    {
      "address": "myso",
      "name": "event"
    },
